{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19197","headline":"秋斋独坐寄乐天兼呈吴方之大夫 · 刘禹锡","name":"秋斋独坐寄乐天兼呈吴方之大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空斋寂寂不生尘，药物方书绕病身。\n纤草数茎胜静地，幽禽忽至似佳宾。\n世间忧喜虽无定，释氏销磨尽有因。\n同向洛阳闲度日，莫教风景属他人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}